"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">소속대학 총장 명의 추천서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">(총장 명의 공문으로 대체 가능)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\">4. <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">참가신청 기간 및 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">접수 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">’11.9. 7(수) 09:00 ~ ’11. 9. 29(목) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\">참가신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\">(온라인 접수) : 교육과학기술부 글로벌인턴지원단 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\">홈페이지(west.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTE